Root cause:
The bug was caused by the removal of the handling for the FL_NOIRQ board flag in the IRQ allocation process when implementing MSI(-X) support. This led to incorrect behavior when the FL_NOIRQ flag was set, as the code did not properly set the IRQ to 0 for devices that should not use interrupts, resulting in potential misconfiguration of the serial ports.
